│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ ring_cross_entanglement                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ The current ansatz uses a linear CZ chain (7 gates: 0-1, 1-2, ..., 6-7) for entanglement. │
│                          │ This has diameter 7, meaning information takes many ansatz blocks to propagate across all │
│                          │ qubits.                                                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ I replace this with:                                                                      │
│                          │ 1. Even pairs CZ (0-1, 2-3, 4-5, 6-7) - 4 parallel gates                                  │
│                          │ 2. Odd pairs CZ (1-2, 3-4, 5-6, 7-0) - completes the ring, 4 parallel gates               │
│                          │ 3. Cross connections CZ (0-4, 1-5, 2-6, 3-7) - long-range entanglement, 4 parallel gates  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This creates a graph with diameter ~2, meaning any qubit can communicate with any other   │
│                          │ in just 2 hops. The total CZ count goes from 7 to 12, but parameter count stays at 24 per │
│                          │ block (146 total) since CZ gates are parameter-free.                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected improvements:                                                                    │
│                          │ - Faster convergence due to better information flow                                       │
│                          │ - Potentially higher accuracy from richer entanglement structure                          │
│                          │ - Same parameter count, so no loss in parameter efficiency                                │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.3533                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
