│ patch_description        │ Combines the full independent RY+RZ rotation layers (16 params/block, proven best         │
│                          │ expressivity) with a 3-layer entanglement structure: (1) even brick CZ, (2) odd brick CZ  │
│                          │ closing the ring, and (3) cross-ring diameter CZ connections forming a hypercube-like     │
│                          │ topology. The cross-ring CZ gates (0-4, 1-5, 2-6, 3-7) allow information to propagate     │
│                          │ across the entire 8-qubit register in a single block application rather than requiring    │
│                          │ multiple ring hops. This should lower validation loss by improving the circuit's ability  │
│                          │ to correlate distant qubits, while keeping the same parameter count (98) as the best      │
│                          │ prior design.                                                                             │
